-------------------------------------------------

WWBBSCtrlChat v1.2
Control Chat programs for WWBBSChat

-------------------------------------------------

You can enable/disable char programs, no beeps, no windows

Use
ACTION=Enable/Disable Chat,WWBBSCtrlChat "%s"
and/or
ACTION=Status Chat,WWBBSCtrlChat "%s" STATUS
in Tools Type of WWBBS.info

Use Cli Mode
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> ENABLE
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> DISABLE
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> ENABLE QUIET
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> DISABLE QUIET
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> ENABLE STATUS
WWBBSCtrlChat <node name> DISABLE STATUS

warning: If Amiga Reboot all chat status change Enable mode

WWBBSCtrlChat ?
NODE/A,ENABLE/S,DISABLE/S,STATUS/S,QUIET/S

